                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 212.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">American Mission, Egypt</hi>, 1887.</head>
                <p>This mission was begun in November, 1854, by the Rev. T. McCague.</p>
                <p>Its present staff of foreign missionaries consists of 11 ordained missionaries, 1
                    physician, 10 unmarried female missionaries, 10 married ladies; total, 32.</p>
                <p>The mission carries on its work in three departments, which may be called the
                    evangelistic, the educational, and the book distribution.</p>
